bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]XPrompts tab jump[/bold #D7AFFF]                                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]xprompts[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shared[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]xprompts: wire the XPrompt browser's non-header rows onto the shared [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mixin and reserve the apostrophe in the filter-first browser input while[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the filter is empty.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Projects tab jump across all three sub-tabs[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]projects[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shared[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]projects: wire the projects list and the shared repo/workspace inventory[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pane base onto the shared mixin so each sub-tab jumps within its own [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rows.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Updates tab jump for Plugins and Agent CLIs[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]updates[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shared[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]updates: wire the Updates pane's active-sub-tab option list onto the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared mixin, skipping group headers and no-opping on the list-free Core[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sub-tab.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Config tab jump over visible tree rows[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]config[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shared[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]config: wire the config field tree onto the shared mixin by decorating [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]node labels in place, without rebuilding the tree or disturbing fold [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]state.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Statistics tab jump to numbered views[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]statistics[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shared[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]statistics: make the apostrophe arm the existing numbered-view selection[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]so the already visible strip numbers act as the tab's jump hints.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation and full-suite verification[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after tasks, xprompts, projects, updates, config, statistics[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: document the Admin Center-wide apostrophe jump in the ACE guide [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and run the exhaustive verification lane over the combined tree.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-gv","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","phase_bead_id":"sase-gv.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-e25d59f1506b1e9211bbb64be8936b62","started_at":"2026-08-07T13:58:05.548663+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-gv","bbugyi200.athena.sase-gv.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-gv.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-gv.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-gv.4","bbugyi200.athena.sase-gv.5","bbugyi200.athena.sase-gv.6","bbugyi200.athena.sase-gv.7","bbugyi200.athena.sase-gv.8","bbugyi200.athena.sase-gv.land"]}
